{"version":1,"title":"[江子社]4 * H20-3e 本地部署 DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 记录 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">文章</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/%E6%B1%9F%E5%AD%90%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E7%A4%BE/\">江子通信社</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">1753 字 · 约 6 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-04T06:33:15.000Z\">2026-08-04</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-08-05T05:53:24.388Z\">2026-08-05</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[江子社]4 * H20-3e 本地部署 DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 记录</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><h2 id=\"写在前面\">写在前面</h2>\n<p>7 月时，我从学长那得到了使用算力平台的权限，需要我通过 vLLM 部署大模型，接入 Agent 完成一些任务。经过一段时间的摸索、以及恰逢 7 月 31 日 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 正式版发布（DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731，下文简称 DSV4F0731）。经过我的评估<s>和尝鲜的心态</s>，我决定在这台 4 * H20-3e（4 * 140 GB VRAM）的服务器上部署 DSV4F0731。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不兼容的-CUDA\">不兼容的 CUDA</h2>\n<p>平台有一个规则：每 2 小时检测一次 GPU 使用情况，若低于 10% 则强制关机，关机后磁盘数据将会被重置。因此学长叫我自己写一个小脚本放后台跑着，避免麻烦。</p>\n<p>当我运行脚本时，弹出了 CUDA 版本过旧的问题：本机 CUDA 版本为 12.8，而 torch 需要 13.0 及以上的版本。</p>\n<p>问题本不大，但平台没有国际互联网连接，这问题可就不小了。</p>\n<p>我并没有在网上搜到 torch 的清华源，阿里源则不知道为什么用不了。又经过一番搜索，从一个不起眼的角落找到了南京大学镜像：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>install_torch.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">uv pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://mirrors.nju.edu.cn/pytorch/whl/cu128 -U</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>当时的我并没有意识到这个兼容性问题日后会给我带来多大的麻烦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下载-DSV4F0731-权重文件\">下载 DSV4F0731 权重文件</h2>\n<p>选择通过 ModelScope 下载，速度很快：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">modelscope download --model deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Base --local_dir ./DSV4Flash0731</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin colorful note\" color=\"green\"><div class=\"title\"><strong><p>Abstract Nonsense</p>\n</strong></div><div class=\"body\"><p>速度很快还有一方面原因是权重文件本身并不大。你梁叔叔依旧外星科技，仅凭后训练就大幅提升模型水准这一块。</p></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"安装-vLLM\">安装 vLLM</h2>\n<p>vLLM 是一个本地部署框架，可以高效部署大模型。这一步耗费了我最久时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"讨厌的-CUDA-12-8\">讨厌的 CUDA 12.8</h3>\n<p>官方手册上给出的安装方式用到了 uv 包管理器的 <code>--torch-backend=auto</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">uv pip install vllm --torch-backend=auto</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<blockquote>\n<p>uv 可以在运行时通过 <code>--torch-backend=auto</code>（或 <code>UV_TORCH_BACKEND=auto</code>）检查系统配置，自动选择合适的 PyTorch 索引</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>然而，无论我选择 <code>--torch-backend=auto</code> 还是 <code>--torch-backend=cu128</code>，在安装完毕执行 <code>vllm</code> 进行验证时，均报错：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">ImportError: libcudart.so.13: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>在 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://discuss.vllm.ai\">vLLM 讨论组</a>，我找到了一个与我遇到同样问题的讨论<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn1\" id=\"fnref1\">[1]</a></sup>。</p>\n<p>这个报错是因为 vLLM 源码尝试导入 CUDA 13.0 导致的。我甚是奇怪，这说明 <code>--torch-backend=auto</code> 没有生效。</p>\n<p>于是我就手动指定 <code>--torch-backend=cu128</code>，结果也没有成功。</p>\n<p>在此期间，我反复重装虚拟环境，尝试从不同的源下载 torch 和 vLLM，均未能成功。然后就不得已求助了学长。</p>\n<h3 id=\"升级-CUDA-12-9\">升级 CUDA 12.9</h3>\n<p>结果学长说可以通过下方命令提升 CUDA 版本：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">export</span> LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/cuda/compat:<span class=\"variable\">$LD_LIBRARY_PATH</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>在 <code>/usr/local/</code> 下有：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">ls</span> /usr/local/</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">bin  cuda  cuda-12  cuda-12.9  etc  games  include  lib  man  pkgconfig  sbin  share  src</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>该命令执行完后，我发现 CUDA 版本提升到了 12.9。</p>\n<p>虽然没能升到 13.0，不过这倒是有了重大进展，因为讨论组帖主所说正是使用 CUDA 12.9 的情况，说不定可以从其中发现问题所在。</p>\n<blur>在正式开始之前，我又重装了若干遍虚拟环境，将之前的 cu128 改成 cu129</blur>\n<h3 id=\"讨厌的-CUDA-12-9\">讨厌的 CUDA 12.9</h3>\n<p>在 vLLM 文档中提到：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>目前，vLLM 的二进制文件默认使用 CUDA 12.9 和公共 PyTorch 发布版本进行编译。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>但是毫无疑问地，我没能成功安装，原因仍然是试图导入 CUDA 13.0。</p>\n<p>我先试着按照这个帖子的方法<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn1\" id=\"fnref1:1\">[1:1]</a></sup>安装支持 CUDA 12.9 的 vLLM 0.20.0，却遗憾地发现该版本无论是 <code> --reasoning-parser</code>、<code> --tokenizer-mode</code> 还是 <code>--tool-call-parser</code> 都不支持 <code>deepseek-v4</code> 作为参数。</p>\n<p>随后我发现另一个帖子中给出了适用于 vLLM 0.24.0 的安装方法<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn2\" id=\"fnref2\">[2]</a></sup>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">uv pip install vllm==0.24.0 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --torch-backend=cu129 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --extra-index-url https://wheels.vllm.ai/0.24.0/cu129/ \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --extra-index-url https://mirrors.nju.edu.cn/pytorch/whl/cu129 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --index-strategy unsafe-best-match \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --system</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>核心是指定 <code>--extra-index-url</code> 为 vLLM 提供的支持 CUDA 12.9 的 wheels，这个源下载速度非常可观。</p>\n<h2 id=\"启动-vLLM\">启动 vLLM</h2>\n<p>安装完成后，便尝试启动 vLLM 部署大模型。结果又踩了不少坑。</p>\n<p>7 月 6 日的论文<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn3\" id=\"fnref3\">[3]</a></sup>提出了名为 DSpark 的推理加速框架。并且 vLLM 给出的 Recipe 中也包含了这一可选项<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn4\" id=\"fnref4\">[4]</a></sup>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vllm serve deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --trust-remote-code \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --kv-cache-dtype fp8 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --block-size 256 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --enable-expert-parallel \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --tensor-parallel-size 8 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --reasoning-parser deepseek_v4 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --tool-call-parser deepseek_v4 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --enable-auto-tool-choice \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --speculative-config <span class=\"string\">'{\"method\":\"dspark\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":7,\"draft_sample_method\":\"greedy\"}'</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>作为一个 New Feature，我自然希望能体验到，然而当我将 <code>--speculative-config</code> 填入的时候，竟然提示参数不在可选范围内。仔细一看，最新的 vLLM 是上周发布的 0.26.0，已经和我相差两个版本了。于是我又将 <code>https://wheels.vllm.ai/0.24.0/cu129/</code> 换成 <code>https://wheels.vllm.ai/0.26.0/cu129/</code>，重走一遍安装流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滚木的版本号\">滚木的版本号</h3>\n<p>一切就绪后，我运行启动脚本：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><figcaption><span>start.sh</span></figcaption><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># After source build, vllm links against CUDA 12 which is in default LD_LIBRARY_PATH</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">export</span> LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/cuda/compat:<span class=\"variable\">$LD_LIBRARY_PATH</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># skip version check for flashinfer,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># since latest flashinfer is 0.6.14 while lates flashinfer-cubin is 0.6.13</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">export</span> FLASHINFER_DISABLE_VERSION_CHECK=1</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">vllm serve /volume/wzhang/ljy/DSV4Flash0731 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --served-model-name my-model \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --trust-remote-code \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --kv-cache-dtype fp8 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --block-size 256 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --enable-expert-parallel \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --tensor-parallel-size 4 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --max-model-len 262144 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.90 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --tool-call-parser deepseek_v4 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --enable-auto-tool-choice \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --reasoning-parser deepseek_v4 \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --speculative-config <span class=\"string\">'{\"method\":\"dspark\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":7,\"draft_sample_method\":\"greedy\"}'</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>结果不出意外，再次报错：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">RuntimeError: flashinfer-cubin version (0.6.6) does not match flashinfer version (0.6.14). Please install the same version of both packages. Set FLASHINFER_DISABLE_VERSION_CHECK=1 to bypass this check.</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>这看起来倒是很好解决，将 <code>flashinfer-cubin</code> 版本提升到 0.6.14 就能解决，可是当我检查更新时却发现：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">flashinfer-cubin (0.6.13)</span><br><span class=\"line\">Available versions: 0.6.13, 0.6.12, 0.6.11.post3, 0.6.11.post2, 0.6.11.post1, 0.6.11, 0.6.10.post1, 0.6.10, 0.6.9, 0.6.8.post1, 0.6.8, 0.6.7.post3, 0.6.7.post2, 0.6.7.post1, 0.6.7, 0.6.6, 0.6.5, 0.6.4, 0.6.3, 0.6.2, 0.6.1, 0.6.0, 0.5.3, 0.5.2, 0.5.1, 0.5.0, 0.4.1, 0.4.0</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>PyPI 上 <code>flashinfer-cubin</code> 根本没有 0.6.14 版本。</p>\n<p>我在 GitHub 上找到官方提供的下载方法<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn5\" id=\"fnref5\">[5]</a></sup>是：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">pip install flashinfer-python</span><br><span class=\"line\"> </span><br><span class=\"line\">pip install flashinfer-cubin --index-url https://flashinfer.ai/whl     <span class=\"comment\"># this is the difference</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"> </span><br><span class=\"line\">pip install flashinfer-jit-cache --index-url https://flashinfer.ai/whl/cu129</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># OR </span></span><br><span class=\"line\">pip install flashinfer-jit-cache --index-url https://flashinfer.ai/whl/cu130</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>然而受限于网络因素，这条路暂时不通。因此我退回了 0.24.0+cu129。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接入-Claude-Code-CLI\">接入 Claude Code CLI</h2>\n<p>当服务在 8000 端口上启动时，我的喜悦难以言表。只需在 <code>settings.json</code> 中配置一下模型名和 base_url 就可以体验了。</p>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n<section class=\"footnotes\">\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"fn1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://discuss.vllm.ai/t/install-using-torch-backend-cu129-but-try-to-import-cu13/2601\">Install using -torch-backend=cu129 but try to import cu13 - cieske</a> <a href=\"#fnref1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a> <a href=\"#fnref1:1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://discuss.vllm.ai/t/how-can-i-use-vllm-with-cuda-12-9/2765/5\">How can I use vllm with cuda 12.9 - helloqiua</a> <a href=\"#fnref2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn3\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.05147\">DSpark: Confidence-Scheduled Speculative Decoding with Semi-Autoregressive Generation</a> <a href=\"#fnref3\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn4\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://recipes.vllm.ai/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash\">vLLM Recipes - deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash</a> <a href=\"#fnref4\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn5\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/3808\">0.6.14 release is still blocked by a project wide 10GB limit<br>\n#3808</a> <a href=\"#fnref5\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}